1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,220
Sit down, kid, I see that worry

2
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:07,140
'Cause I used to wear it too

3
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:10,020
I'm the man you're gonna be

4
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:14,340
A few more miles down from you

5
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:17,380
I can't tell you what is coming

6
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:20,580
And I wouldn't if I could

7
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:24,660
But I can save you years of learning

8
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:28,340
What is worth it and what's no good

9
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:35,540
Everybody shows up for the party when the music's playing loud

10
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:42,740
But when there's work that needs doing, watch how quick you lose the crowd

11
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:49,700
They'll always have a reason why tonight they can't come by

12
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:56,100
But the few who roll their sleeves up never have to tell you why

13
00:00:56,900 --> 00:01:00,500
I learned it watching who was there for every fun event

14
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:04,260
Then who had excuses ready when the hard news came and went

15
00:01:04,260 --> 00:01:05,160
'Cause more ain't always better, and bigger ain't always better
